    "overview": "The autonomous driving industry is at a pivotal point, transitioning from the realm of scientific research to large-scale real-world deployment. This shift is not just a matter of scaling up; it involves integrating complex AI systems that can understand and interact with the physical and social aspects of driving. The debate now centers on how effectively companies can make this leap, with implications for technology, regulation, and societal acceptance.",
