    "overview": "The debate around AI and its impact on free speech and digital freedom is critical in the context of global diplomacy and commerce. As AI becomes more integrated into communication and decision-making processes, the values embedded in AI systems will shape international relations and the flow of information. The current landscape is marked by a push for Western values of individual consent and rule-based operations within AI, which is seen as a counterbalance to authoritarian models. The urgency of this debate is heightened by the rapid development of AI technologies and the potential for these technologies to be used as tools of control or freedom.",
