    "investment_thesis": "The core logic is that AI will be a catalyst for change across multiple sectors, with semiconductors and stablecoins being key beneficiaries. The timeframe for vindication is within the next five years, where observable developments such as sustained growth in semiconductor sales and regulatory clarity for stablecoins would validate the thesis. Conversely, a lack of significant AI adoption or regulatory crackdowns on stablecoins would invalidate it.",
